evidence of anything; it is never a pass. A packet with a BLOCKED
gate is not an adoption packet.

THIS IS A REHEARSAL. It proves the packet drives correct S3 requests,
reads the answers, restores the right database and cleans up after
itself. It proves nothing about the OVH test region, class, pricing,
lifecycle implementation or TLS. Re-run the same script with
--i-have-owner-go-ahead and DG_SANDBOX_ENDPOINT pointing at the OVH
endpoint to produce §6 evidence.

